Parity reproduced from the web leaf (props: drive: YearReviewDriveHighlight|null, label, emoji):
  • hours       = Math.floor(duration_min / 60)                [floor toward -inf; exact JS parity]
  • mins        = duration_min % 60   → `${h}h ${m}m` / `${m}m`
  • distDisplay = Math.round(convertDistanceFromSI(distance_km*1000, distanceUnit))   [ungrouped String]
  • effDisplay  = distanceUnit==='mi' ? efficiency_wh_km * 1.609344 : efficiency_wh_km
  • effShown    = efficiency_wh_km > 0 ? Math.round(effDisplay) : '—'   (unit Wh/mi | Wh/km)
  • route       = (start_address || '—')  →  (end_address || '—')   [MapPin / arrow.right]
  • !drive      → emoji + "No drive data for this year"  (web empty branch, reproduced 1:1)
  • 🏆 spring scale+rotate-in · uppercased label · frosted card { route · 3-up grid · date }
Conversion constants ported 1:1 from lib/unitConversion.ts: METERS_PER_KM 1000 / METERS_PER_MILE 1609.344 /
METERS_PER_FOOT 0.3048; KM_PER_MILE 1.609344 (web source const). Distance unit symbol from the pref
(km/mi/ft); efficiency unit flips on miles only (km AND ft keep Wh/km — faithful to `=== 'mi'`).
